7,"Chin, Paite Language (PCK) – L1 & L2 Speakers... | Ethnologue Free",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/pck/,"Paite Chin is a stable indigenous language of India. It belongs to the Sino-Tibetan language family. Direct evidence is lacking, but the language is thought to be used as a first language by all in the ethnic community.","Chin, Paite",Sino-Tibetan
