9,Endangered Languages Project - Paite Chin,https://www.endangeredlanguages.com/lang/pck,"Sino-Tibetan, Kukish. CODE AUTHORITY.""Paite is taught up to graduate level as a subject of instruction in Manipur. The All India Radio station at Imphal broadcasts Paite programs daily for 25 minutes."" (pg. 100). Vulnerable (20 percent certain, based on the evidence available).","Chin, Paite",Sino-Tibetan
